WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.531
WhatsApp Customer Care course mein aapka welcome hai.

2
00:00:04.531 --> 00:00:09.248
Module one. WhatsApp Business API ki basics, aur dashboard ka tour.

3
00:00:11.433 --> 00:00:16.594
Customers pehle se WhatsApp pe rahte hain. Oribrix ke liye ye savalon ke jawaab

4
00:00:16.594 --> 00:00:22.016
Dene, order updates bhejne aur customers ko vaapas laane ki sabse achhi jaghon mein

5
00:00:22.016 --> 00:00:27.439
Se ek hai. Ye course dikhata hai ki WhatsApp Business API platform kaise kaam karta

6
00:00:27.439 --> 00:00:30.313
Hai, taaki aap ise bharose se use kar saken.

7
00:00:30.763 --> 00:00:34.219
Pehle, WhatsApp Business API asal mein hai kyaa.

8
00:00:34.669 --> 00:00:39.000
Phir ye aapke phone ke normal WhatsApp app se kaise alag hai.

9
00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:43.695
Phir businesses ise chaar main tarikon se kaise use karte hain.

10
00:00:44.145 --> 00:00:47.580
Phir onboard hone se pehle business ko kya chahiye.

11
00:00:48.030 --> 00:00:51.208
Phir Meta jo daily message limits set karta hai.

12
00:00:51.658 --> 00:00:54.368
Aur aakhir mein, main dashboard ka tour.

13
00:00:56.767 --> 00:01:02.228
WhatsApp Business API un medium aur large businesses ke liye bana hai jinhe bade

14
00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:07.690
Scale pe customers se baat karni hoti hai. Ise normal app se compare karte hain.

15
00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:13.320
Normal WhatsApp app yaani ek phone aur ek insan jo haath se type karta hai.

16
00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:18.777
Iska aapke systems se koi connection nahi, aur ye kuch gini chuni chats ke liye

17
00:01:18.777 --> 00:01:19.468
Theek hai.

18
00:01:19.918 --> 00:01:24.932
Business API mein kayi agents ek number share kar sakte hain, aapke system se

19
00:01:24.932 --> 00:01:30.207
Messages automatically jaate hain, ye aapki website, app ya C R M se connect hota

20
00:01:30.207 --> 00:01:35.221
Hai, aur bahut saari chats handle karta hai. Brands ise alerts, O T Ps, order

21
00:01:35.221 --> 00:01:40.691
Updates aur offers ke liye use karte hain, kyunki WhatsApp messages ka open aur read

22
00:01:40.691 --> 00:01:43.491
Rate lagbhag har channel se zyada hota hai.

23
00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:49.729
WhatsApp Business API use karne ke chaar main tareeke hain.

24
00:01:49.729 --> 00:01:55.115
Customer care ke liye doosra aur chautha sabse zyada matter karte hain, lekin aapko

25
00:01:55.115 --> 00:01:56.737
Charon pata hone chahiye.

26
00:01:57.187 --> 00:02:02.799
Ek, marketing. Un customers ko promotional messages bhejna jinhonne opt in kiya hai,

27
00:02:02.799 --> 00:02:08.410
Bina number ban hone ke risk ke. Aap opt-ins aur opt-outs manage kar sakte hain, aur

28
00:02:08.410 --> 00:02:11.417
Delivery aur read rates track kar sakte hain.

29
00:02:11.867 --> 00:02:17.909
Do, live chat aur shared inbox. Fifteen tak agents mobile ya desktop se login karke

30
00:02:17.909 --> 00:02:21.403
Customers se real time mein chat kar sakte hain.

31
00:02:21.853 --> 00:02:28.066
Teen, API integration. Aapki website ya app automatically messages bhejti hai, jaise

32
00:02:28.066 --> 00:02:33.910
O T Ps, alerts aur order updates. Ye Shopify aur WooCommerce jaise shops se bhi

33
00:02:33.910 --> 00:02:35.463
Connect ho sakta hai.

34
00:02:35.913 --> 00:02:41.445
Chaar, chatbot. Ek automatic assistant jo common savalon ke jawaab deta hai, leads

35
00:02:41.445 --> 00:02:46.976
Capture karta hai aur customers ko guide karta hai, drag and drop builder se bana,

36
00:02:46.976 --> 00:02:47.988
Bina coding ke.

37
00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:54.431
API use karne se pehle business ko chaar cheezein chahiye.

38
00:02:54.431 --> 00:02:57.419
Platform ke saath onboarding khud free hai.

39
00:02:57.869 --> 00:03:03.469
Ek phone number jo WhatsApp pe bilkul na ho. Na normal app pe, na WhatsApp Business

40
00:03:03.469 --> 00:03:06.167
Pe. Agar hai, toh pehle use hatana hoga.

41
00:03:06.617 --> 00:03:09.199
Ek Facebook page, ya ek website.

42
00:03:09.649 --> 00:03:13.595
Ek Facebook account jo kam se kam six months purana ho.

43
00:03:14.045 --> 00:03:20.680
Aur verification ke liye business documents, jaise G S T ya M S M E registration.

44
00:03:23.067 --> 00:03:27.208
Ye yaad rakhiye, kyunki onboarding mein sabse common galti yahi hai.

45
00:03:27.208 --> 00:03:32.262
Jo number aap API se connect karte hain, wo pehle se WhatsApp pe nahi hona chahiye,

46
00:03:32.262 --> 00:03:35.184
Na normal app mein na WhatsApp Business app men.

47
00:03:35.184 --> 00:03:39.873
Naya number use kijiye, ya pehle us number se WhatsApp account delete kijiye.

48
00:03:39.873 --> 00:03:44.379
API pe aane ke baad aap us number ko phone app mein use nahi kar paayenge.

49
00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:39.678
Meta ek daily limit set karta hai ki aap kitne logon ko message kar sakte hain.

50
00:04:39.678 --> 00:04:44.021
Ye chhoti shuru hoti hai aur achhe behaviour ke saath badhti hai.

51
00:04:44.471 --> 00:04:48.247
Shuru mein limit lagbhag two thousand log per day hoti hai.

52
00:04:48.697 --> 00:04:53.412
Business account verify hone ke baad aap badhna shuru kar sakte hain.

53
00:04:53.862 --> 00:04:57.891
Meta dekhta hai ki aapke campaigns kaisa perform karte hain.

54
00:04:57.891 --> 00:05:03.532
Aise messages jo log chahte hain, aur kam blocks ya reports, aapke favour mein jaate

55
00:05:03.532 --> 00:05:03.867
Hain.

56
00:05:04.317 --> 00:05:07.347
Limit ten thousand per day tak badh sakti hai.

57
00:05:07.797 --> 00:05:13.284
Aur samay ke saath one lakh per day taka. Spam wale messages ulta asar karte hain

58
00:05:13.284 --> 00:05:15.519
Aur number restrict ho sakta hai.

59
00:05:17.933 --> 00:05:21.619
Login ke baad pehli screen main dashboard hoti hai.

60
00:05:21.619 --> 00:05:22.776
Isme ye sab hai.

61
00:05:23.226 --> 00:05:28.552
Live status. Facebook account aur number connect hone ke baad account live dikhta

62
00:05:28.552 --> 00:05:28.815
Hai.

63
00:05:29.265 --> 00:05:32.892
Meta ka daily messaging limit, jo hamne abhi dekha.

64
00:05:33.342 --> 00:05:38.746
Profile aur display picture. Wo picture aur About text jo customers dekhte hain.

65
00:05:38.746 --> 00:05:42.259
Yahan Oribrix logo aur ek clear description rakhiye.

66
00:05:42.709 --> 00:05:48.450
Wallet credit. Messages isi balance se pay hote hain, isliye bade campaign se pehle

67
00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:51.562
Check kijiye aur zaroorat pe recharge kijiye.

68
00:05:52.012 --> 00:05:57.948
WhatsApp link aur Q R. Ek link ya Q R code banaiye jo Oribrix se chat kholta hai.

69
00:05:57.948 --> 00:06:02.124
Ye invoices, visiting cards aur posters pe kaam aata hai.

70
00:06:02.574 --> 00:06:07.076
Aur website widget, website ke liye ek chhota WhatsApp chat button.

71
00:06:09.467 --> 00:06:12.390
Kuch words jo is poore course mein aayenge.

72
00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:17.917
W A B A, yaani WhatsApp Business Account jo Meta ke paas hota hai.

73
00:06:18.367 --> 00:06:24.565
B S P, yaani Business Solution Provider. Wo company jiska platform aap API chalane

74
00:06:24.565 --> 00:06:27.967
Ke liye use karte hain, jaise is course wala.

75
00:06:28.417 --> 00:06:32.833
Template. Ek message format jo Meta pehle se approve karta hai.

76
00:06:32.833 --> 00:06:36.758
Conversation shuru karne ke liye iski zaroorat hoti hai.

77
00:06:37.208 --> 00:06:42.700
Opt-in aur opt-out. Customer ne messages paane ke liye haan kaha hai, ya rokne ko

78
00:06:42.700 --> 00:06:43.310
Kaha hai.

79
00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:49.195
Aur twenty four hour window. Customer ke message karne ke baad aap twenty four hours

80
00:06:49.195 --> 00:06:53.594
Tak freely reply kar sakte hain. Uske baad phir se template chahiye.

81
00:06:56.000 --> 00:07:01.194
Quick check. Oribrix apna office number connect karna chahta hai, jo pehle se

82
00:07:01.194 --> 00:07:04.770
WhatsApp Business app pe hai. Pehle kya hona chahiye?

83
00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:05.984
Ek second sochiye.

84
00:07:09.934 --> 00:07:13.424
Answer: pehle us number se WhatsApp hatana hoga.

85
00:07:13.424 --> 00:07:17.059
API number kisi bhi WhatsApp app pe nahi ho sakta.

86
00:07:19.867 --> 00:07:22.427
Module one ko summarise karte hain.

87
00:07:22.877 --> 00:07:29.021
API se ek number pe kayi agents, automation, integrations aur scale milta hai.

88
00:07:29.471 --> 00:07:34.719
Ye marketing, live chat, automatic alerts aur chatbots ke liye use hota hai.

89
00:07:35.169 --> 00:07:40.124
Shuru karne ke liye fresh number, Facebook page ya website, six month purana

90
00:07:40.124 --> 00:07:43.318
Facebook account, aur business documents chahiye.

91
00:07:43.768 --> 00:07:49.336
Daily limit lagbhag two thousand se shuru hokar achhe use ke saath badhti hai.

92
00:07:49.786 --> 00:07:55.455
Aur dashboard mein status, limit, profile, wallet, link aur Q R, aur website widget

93
00:07:55.455 --> 00:07:59.621
Dikhte hain. Module two mein hum message templates banayenge.

94
00:08:02.033 --> 00:08:07.260
Module 1 yahin khatam hota hai. Agla hai module 2: Message templates.
